      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "我默不作声。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I remained silent.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01173",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "面临世界的悲惨结局，我还有义务还债吗？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Facing the tragic end of the world, was I still obliged to repay my debt?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01173",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "我受诱惑的驱使，本想以此向柏木做点暗示，但又打消了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Driven by temptation, I had meant to use this to hint something to Kashiwagi, but then I thought better of it.",
